WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:03.770
&gt;&gt;&gt; NEW CNN REPORTING
THIS MORNING ON SENATOR LINDSEY

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.372
GRAHAM'S PROPOSED BAN ON
ABORTION AFTER 15 WEEKS OF

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:07.340
PREGNANCY.
A NATIONAL BAN.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:11.678
A SOURCE TELLS CNN THAT THE
PROPOSAL WAS INTENDED TO ARM

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:14.981
REPUBLICANS WITH A POLICY ISSUE
THEY COULD RALLY AROUND AHEAD OF

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:18.718
THE MIDTERM ELECTIONS.
SENATOR GRAHAM'S CURRENT STANCE

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.721
IS A REVERSAL FROM HIS PREVIOUS
POSITION.

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.924
&gt;&gt; I'VE BEEN CONSISTENT.
I THINK STATES SHOULD DECIDE THE

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:28.228
ISSUE OF MARRIAGE AND STATES
SHOULD DECIDE THE ISSUE OF

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:31.697
ABORTION.
I THINK WE SHOULD HAVE A LAW, AT

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:36.435
THE FEDERAL LEVEL, THAT WOULD
SAY, AFTER 15 WEEKS, NO ABORTION

00:00:36.435 --> 00:00:40.473
ON DEMAND, EXCEPT IN CASES OF
RAPE, INCEST, TO SAVE THE LIFE

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:44.710
OF ANOTHER.
&gt;&gt; CONSISTENT, NO.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:51.251
JOINING US NOW IS CNN CAPITOL
HILL REPORTER MELANIE ZANONA AND

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:54.988
ISAAC DOVARE.
WHY DID THE SENATOR DO THIS?

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:57.891
&gt;&gt; I KNOW A LOT OF PEOPLE HAVE
BEEN SCRATCHING THEIR HEADS OVER

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.560
THIS MOVE.
SO I TALKED TO SOME REPUBLICANS

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.028
ABOUT WHY IS LINDSEY GRAHAM
DOING THIS?

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:05.999
IT BOILS DOWN TO THIS.
REPUBLICANS PRIVATELY

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:09.469
ACKNOWLEDGE THEIR MESSAGING ON
ABORTION HAS NOT WORKED.

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:13.273
THEIR ATTEMPTS TO RUN AWAY FROM
THE ISSUE HAVE NOT WORKED.

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:17.543
SO THERE ARE SOME IN THE PARTY,
INCLUDING LINDSEY GRAHAM, WHO

00:01:17.543 --> 00:01:23.749
THINKS IT'S BETTER TO ADDRESS
THE ISSUE HEAD ON AND SHOW THE

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:28.721
AMERICAN PEOPLE HOW THEY FEEL
ABOUT ABORTION AND TRY TO GET

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:34.394
THE DEMOCRATS ON DEFENSE.
BUT OF COURSE NOT EVERYONE IN

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.896
THE PARTY AGREES THAT THIS IS A
GOOD STRATEGY RIGHT BEFORE THE

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:43.002
MIDTERMS, ESPECIALLY BECAUSE
IT'S NOT A POPLULAR POSITION IN

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:46.940
THE KEY BATTLEGROUND DISTRICTS,
HOUSE CONSERVATIVES ARE DIVIDED

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:51.143
OVER THIS.
I REPORTED THAT, THERE WAS A

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.613
HEATED MEETING WHERE YOU HAVE
CONSERVATIVES SOME SAYING IT

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:59.719
GOES TOO FAR, SOME NOT FAR
ENOUGH.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:05.491
THEY'RE RUOLLING OUT NEXT WEEK
LAW THAT JUST SAYS WE'RE GOING

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:09.395
TO PROTECT THE LIVES OF THE
UNBORN CHILD.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:12.098
&gt;&gt; IT JUST THROWS THE MIDTERMS
INTO QUESTION.

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:15.335
HOW IS THIS GOING TO IMPACT THE
RESULTS THERE.

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:18.304
INDIANA'S PASSED LAW BANNING
ABORTIONS WENT INTO EFFECT

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:22.742
TODAY.
OHIO'S BAN ON ABORTIONS AT SIX

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.611
WEEKS.
THE MAP YOU ARE LOOKING AT, SHOW

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:29.916
THE STATE-BY-STATE CHANGES,
SINCE THE JUNE DECISION TO WIPE

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:33.086
ROE V. WADE OFF OF THE BOOKS.
DEMOCRATS SEE THAT ANGER IS

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:36.322
HELPING THEM IN THE MIDTERM
CAMPAIGN.

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:39.993
NOW, THERE'S GRUMBLING THAT ONE
OF THEIR OWN MIGHT BE GIVING THE

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:46.599
DEMOCRATS A GIFT.
LINDSEY GRAHAM JUST INTRODUCED

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:50.270
LEGISLATION OF BANNING ABORTIONS
AT 15 WEEKS.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:55.641
NOW, MIDTERM FUEL.
&gt;&gt; IF THERE IS ANY DOUBT ABOUT

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:58.344
REPUBLICANS' TRUE INTENTIONS,
ABOUT THE EXTREME ABORTION

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:01.948
PLANS, THERE'S NO QUESTION AFTER
THIS WEEK.

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:06.653
THEIR PLAN IS PLAIN AS DAY.
REPUBLICANS WANT TO BAN ABORTION

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:15.695
IN EVERY SINGLE STATE AND THEY
WANT TO PUNISH DOCTORS.

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:19.699
&gt;&gt; PATTY MURRAY, A DEMOCRAT ON
THE BALLOT, IN A RACE WE'RE

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:29.108
KEEPING AN EYE ON.
&gt;&gt; WE SHOULD APPLAUD POLITICIANS

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:36.282
THAT MAKE THEIR BELIEFS KNOWN.
&gt;&gt; ONE OF THE THINGS FOR

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:43.823
REPUBLICANS IS THEY WANTED TO
RETURN ABORTION RIGHTS TO THE

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:46.025
STATES.
THIS TAKES THAT OFF OF THE

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:47.427
TABLE.
AND REPUBLICAN COLLEAGUES HEARD

00:03:47.427 --> 00:03:49.462
THAT.
AND NUMBER TWO, THE DAY THIS

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:52.799
HAPPENED WAS NOT A DAY OF GREAT
ECONOMIC NEWS FOR THE BIDEN

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:57.103
ADMINISTRATION.
AND IT COMPLETELY WIPED THAT OUT

00:03:57.103 --> 00:03:59.839
OF THE NEWS INSTEAD, WE'RE
TALKING ABOUT LINDSEY GRAHAM.

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:03.943
AND NONE OF THE SENATE
COLLEAGUES WANTED TO DISCUSS IT.

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:05.311
THEY WANTED TO TALK ABOUT THE
ECONOMY ALL DAY.

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:08.648
AND YOU SEE THE DEMOCRATS
GLEEFULLY SKIPPING AROUND THE

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:10.583
CAPITOL ALL DAY.
THIS WAS A GIFT FOR THEM.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:12.385
&gt;&gt; THERE'S PLENTY OF EVIDENCE
OUT THERE.

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:15.555
IN A LOT OF PLACES, NOT
EVERYWHERE, BUT IN A LOT OF

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:18.224
PLACES, THIS IS HELPING THE
DEMOCRATS IN THE SUBURB.

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:22.928
WE SAW THE KANSAS REFERENDUM.
DEMOCRATS THINK THIS HELPS WIN

00:04:22.928 --> 00:04:26.032
BACK THE MODERATE REPUBLICANS
AND THE INDEPENDENTS WHO MIGHT

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:28.735
BE READY TO VOTE AGAINST
PRESIDENT BIDEN BECAUSE OF

00:04:28.735 --> 00:04:30.970
INFLATION, BECAUSE OF CRIME.
YOU MENTIONED THE DEMOCRATIC

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.004
GLEE.
LISTEN TO THIS.

00:04:32.004 --> 00:04:36.542
THIS IS SEVERAL OF LINDSEY
GRAHAM'S COLLEAGUES RATHER

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:38.111
UNCOMFORTABLE.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS AN ISSUE THAT PEOPLE

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:41.180
TALK ABOUT.
ULTIMATELY, THE CAMPAIGN -- THE

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.083
ELECTION WILL BE ABOUT THIS
INFLATION.

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:48.688
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINKS IN ANYTHING AT
THE NATIONAL LEVEL THAT COMES

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:54.660
CLOSE TO GETTING 60 VOTES.
&gt;&gt; I SUPPORT THIS GOING OUT TO

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.662
THE STATES AND LETTING PEOPLE
DECIDE.

00:04:56.662 --> 00:05:00.400
&gt;&gt; LET'S BE CLEAR HERE.
THE VAST MAJORITY OF REPUBLICANS

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:06.873
IN CONGRESS WOULD SUPPORT --
HAVE SUPPORTED SOME FORM OF

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.808
ABORTION.
IT'S NOT THEY DON'T SUPPORT THIS

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:11.878
ON THE SUBSTANCE.
WHAT THEY DON'T WANT TO DO IS

00:05:11.878 --> 00:05:17.083
BRING IT UP RIGHT NOW.
THEY KNOW THIS HAS GALVANIZED

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:20.253
MANY VOTERS, INCLUDING
INDEPENDENT VOTERS AND SUBURBAN

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:22.455
VOTERS AND VOTERS THEY NEED IN
NOVEMBER.

00:05:22.455 --> 00:05:29.796
TO TALK ABOUT IT NOW, IT DIVIDES
THE PARTY.

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:31.898
THAT'S SOMETHING YOU NEVER WANT
TO DO EIGHT WEEKS FROM AN

00:05:31.898 --> 00:05:36.536
ELECTION.
AND THE ELECTION IS A CHOICE.

00:05:36.536 --> 00:05:38.771
LINDSEY GRAHAM SAID THIS OUT
LOUD, IF YOU ELECT REPUBLICANS

00:05:38.771 --> 00:05:40.373
THIS KIND OF THINGS WILL GET A
VOTE.

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:43.142
AND IF YOU ELECT DEMOCRATS, IT
PROBABLY NEVER WILL.

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:45.878
AND THAT'S A MESSAGE THAT
REPUBLICANS DON'T WANT VOTERS TO

00:05:45.878 --> 00:05:49.081
THINK ABOUT AS THEY ARE TURNING,
SHOULD I VOTE FOR THE DEMOCRAT

00:05:49.081 --> 00:05:55.321
OR THE REPUBLICAN IN MY STATE?
FOR SOME VOTERS, THAT MIGHT

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:58.057
STEER THEM TOWARDS THE
REPUBLICANS.

00:05:58.057 --> 00:06:03.429
BUT THEY PREFER THAT NOT BE THE
GROUND THAT PEOPLE DECIDE ON.

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:05.698
&gt;&gt; MITCH McCONNELL SAID, IF HE
WOULD -- THE MAN WHO CONTROLS

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:09.135
THE SCHEDULE AND ASSUMING IF
THEY TAKE THE SENATE, HE WOULD

00:06:09.135 --> 00:06:15.508
CONTROL THE SCHEDULE AGAIN.
HE WAS DISMISSIVE OF THAT.

00:06:15.508 --> 00:06:20.213
&gt;&gt; WE JUST TALKED ABOUT THE
NEW HAMPSHIRE SENATE RACE.

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:22.081
MAGGIE HASSAN, IT'S A TOUGH
STATE.

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:25.084
SHE THINKS THIS ISSUE HELPS HER
IN THE SUBURB WHERE'S THE VOTES

00:06:25.084 --> 00:06:29.488
ARE.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS ABOUT WHETHER YOU

00:06:29.488 --> 00:06:36.696
TAKE RIGHTS AWAY FROM HALF OF
THE POPULATION.

00:06:36.696 --> 00:06:40.766
AND WHETHER THEY ARE GOING TO BE
IN THE EXAMINING ROOM.

00:06:40.766 --> 00:06:46.239
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, SENATOR GRAHAM.
&gt;&gt; THERE'S A REASON DEMOCRATS

00:06:46.239 --> 00:06:54.180
ARE FGLEEFUL ABOUT THIS AND
FORCEFUL.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.915
THEY'VE SEEN IT IN THE NUMBERS
AND IN THE KANSAS VOTE.

00:06:55.915 --> 00:07:03.289
UP IN UPSTATE NEW YORK.
O

00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:05.224
OTHER ELECTIONS SINCE THE DOBBS
RULING.

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:09.996
THEY FEEL THEY CAN GO TO THE
POLLS WITH THIS.

00:07:09.996 --> 00:07:12.865
IT'S CHARGED MODERATE VOTERS AND
SOME REPUBLICAN VOTERS THAT

00:07:12.865 --> 00:07:15.568
AREN'T HAPPY ABOUT THAT DECISION
AND AREN'T HAPPY ABOUT

00:07:15.568 --> 00:07:17.770
REPUBLICANS.
&gt;&gt; AND THE DATA SAYS IT HELPS

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:23.409
THE DEMOCRATS.
WE DON'T KNOW IF IT WILL IN

00:07:23.409 --> 00:07:26.078
NOVEMBER.
SOME THINK THAT IT COULD BE SO

00:07:26.078 --> 00:07:27.713
OVERWHELMING, IT COULD BE A
SURPRISE.

00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:31.617
YOU'RE FROM OHIO, THE DEMOCRATIC
RUNNING FOR THE OHIO RACE IN A

00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:38.024
DEMOCRATIC FIRST MIDTERM
ELECTION YEAR.

00:07:38.024 --> 00:07:43.262
THINKING MAYBE THIS ISSUE HELPS.
&gt;&gt; WITHOUT ABORTION, THIS BABY

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:45.965
WOULDN'T BE ON THE WAY RIGHT
NOW.

00:07:45.965 --> 00:07:48.034
MIKE DeWINE HAS BANNED ABORTION
IN OHIO.

00:07:48.034 --> 00:07:53.339
I WOULD HAVE DIED WITHOUT MINE.
&gt;&gt; YOU HAD A HORRIBLE STORY

00:07:53.339 --> 00:07:56.075
ABOUT THE YOUNG GIRL WHO HAD TO
GO TO ANOTHER STATE, WHO WAS 10

00:07:56.075 --> 00:08:01.080
AND ABUSED, TO GET AN ABORTION
IN OHIO.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:05.051
THEY HAD SOME EXTREMELY TRAGIC
CASES ALREADY THAT HAVE MADE

00:08:05.051 --> 00:08:07.186
HEADLINES.
I DON'T KNOW IF IT'S GOING TO

00:08:07.186 --> 00:08:19.699
HELP SOMEONE LIKE MAN WHALEY.
YOU HAVE SEEN SOME --

00:08:19.699 --> 00:08:25.605
CONGRESSMAN RYAN IS SEVERAL
POLLS, AHEAD OF J.D. VANCE AT

00:08:25.605 --> 00:08:29.241
THIS POINT.
YOU'VE SEEN VOTER REGISTRATION,

00:08:29.241 --> 00:08:34.647
AMONG WOMEN, GO UP IN OHIO.
AS YOU SAID, WE DON'T KNOW IF

00:08:34.647 --> 00:08:39.285
THAT WILL HELP DEMOCRATS.
SOME DEMOCRATS THINK IT WILL.

